{
  "name": "@caisson/service-license",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Merchant-of-Record billing webhook + idempotent credit grants + account-entitlement store/resolver + the Ed25519 offline-license ISSUER HTTP surface (ADR-0089/0017/0071/0108). A gated invoice.paid grants cycle credits AND the plan's entitlements; the lazy bearer-gated POST /issue signs an account's resolved entitlements into a license token via @caisson/license-issue.",
